Package: hydromet
Title: Hydrometeorological Tools for Seasonal Adjustment, Breakpoint Regression and Geostrophic Wind
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuyang", "Duan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "1176414487@qq.com"))
Description: Provides hydrological and meteorological utilities: removal of the
    seasonal cycle with month-day climatology (RemoveSeasonal), piecewise
    regression with a common slope and segment-specific intercepts
    (LS_OneBreak, LS_MultiBreaks), and geostrophic wind computed from
    horizontal pressure gradients (CoriolisParameter, GeostrophicWind,
    WindSpeed, WindDirection).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/kavel-2026/hydromet
BugReports: https://github.com/kavel-2026/hydromet/issues
Imports:
    magrittr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
